	"FriendlyName": "NDC Binder",
	"Description": "Binds a Niagara Data Channel write to data instead of a graph. The channel's variables and its access context both become rows in the details panel, and every row is a constant, a field of the event data, or a function on the owning object, bound UMG-style. Framework-agnostic: usable from GameplayCues, abilities, components or plain actors.",
